  "body": "Urgent sale, the owners have their next home lined up and are ready to move, offering a rare opportunity to purchase their much-loved apartment offering lifestyle living with an easy stroll to Okahu Bay. Call now to make an appointment to view.\r\n \r\nThis stylish two-bedroom, two-bathroom home sits within a tightly held boutique development of only 15 residences, completed in 2021.\r\n \r\nPositioned at the end of the building, and just above street level, the courtyard of a lower-level apartment below creates a natural “moat-like” separation, enhancing both security and privacy. The coveted end position allows natural light to flood the beautifully appointed kitchen and living area through well-positioned windows, while opening seamlessly to a generous northwest-facing outdoor room/loggia. Featuring stackable glass sliders, this alfresco space extends the living area and is ideal for year-round entertaining.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are generously proportioned. The primary suite features a walk-in wardrobe and a luxurious, fully tiled ensuite, while the second fully tiled bathroom, finished with sleek matte black accents, is conveniently located off the hallway. The apartment offers high stud ceilings, double glazing, and ducted air conditioning throughout. \r\n \r\nCompleting the package is a secure car park and an exceptional lifestyle location just moments from Orakei cafés and shops, with an easy stroll to Okahu Bay, the Yacht Club, Orakei Bay Village, cinemas, and the beach, perfect for relaxed walks around the bays.\r\n \r\nIdeal as a lock-up-and-leave city base, first home, downsizer, or easy-care lifestyle choice in a prime location. This is a genuine opportunity created by highly motivated sellers; the apartment must be sold. \r\n Act quickly- give us a call now to make an appointment to view. Melissa 021747244, Wendy 021941111",
